  },
  {
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001070030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あっ……えへへ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700107/7007001070030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001070040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ごめんごめん、憧れのあの子と一緒の舞台に立てるって\r\n思ったら、ついおっきい声出しちゃった",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700107/7007001070040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001070050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "や～、今からもう楽しみだな～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700107/7007001070050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "照れ隠し、バレてるからな",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001070060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "う、やめてよそういうこと言うの……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700107/7007001070060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……言われなくてもわかってるとは思うけど\r\nこれは、アイドルのファンのままじゃできなかったことだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華がその子たちのライバルになれたから、\r\nできるようになったことだよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001070070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……うん、わかってる",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700107/7007001070070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001070080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "今回はファンとしてじゃなくて、\r\nライバルとして会うんだもんね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700107/7007001070080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだ\r\n……結華は今、憧れの存在と肩を並べたんだ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001070090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……そんなこと言われたら構えちゃうなぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700107/7007001070090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001070100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……でも！　三峰を応援しててくれてる人たちのためにも\r\n全力でやらないと、だね！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700107/7007001070100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつも全力だろ？　だから、いつも通りでいい\r\nいつも通りやれば大丈夫だ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』、頑張ってこい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s2",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001070110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……やっぱ安心感が違うなぁ……\r\nプロデューサーは、アイドルをやる気にさせる天才かもね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700107/7007001070110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001070120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──まぁ、三峰に任せてよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700107/7007001070120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001070130,
    "speaker": "結華",
